author ai
group gui
note The gui crate's unit tests: the Model and apply exercised with no window, no GPU and no language server, against a four-function source file held in memory. Because views only read the Model and every change goes through apply or nav.rs, the reader's behaviour - selection, walking, history, the per-step toggles, deletions - is tested by calling those directly and reading the Model back. What needs a real window (layout, drawing, gestures) is pinned by the GUI scenarios in the codemap crate's tests (see behaviour-pin).

